[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0010","text":"喂喂────\n是的，之前演唱会的……好的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0020","text":"是问铃木羽那的出演吗？\n当然可以！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0030","text":"是郁田阳希对吧？\n好的，我先记下预约……谢谢您！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0040","text":"大家都好厉害啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0050","text":"（不只是路加\n　羽那和阳希的邀约也在蜂拥而至）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0060","text":"喂喂────是的，承蒙关照！\n好的……CoMETIK的……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0070","text":"下一场，演唱会……是吗──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0080","text":"的确，也是啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0090","text":"大家，做得很好！\n非常棒！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0100","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0110","text":"谢谢，制作人\n……超级开心的──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0120","text":"是的……\n很开心……呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0130","text":"路加────\n你要去哪……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0140","text":"吵死了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0150","text":"没什么好说的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0160","text":"别再叫我了────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0162","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0170","text":"我究竟────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0180","text":"我还想再一起做\n和羽那酱──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0190","text":"……和路加酱一起"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0192","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08020000_01_0200","text":"组合今后的活动，\n请允许我们……暂定为未定────"}]
